{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56289","headline":"及第後作（题拟） · 于观文","name":"及第後作（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东堂令史报来时，仙桂云攀第九枝。\n乍听言音犹似梦，却思公道即无疑。\n寒门髣髴春将到，幽径朦胧月渐移。\n残漏声中鞭马去，紵袍重戴已相随。\n（见《新编分门古今类事》卷七引李畋《该闻录》。\n）（按：《该闻录》云观文「下第後，献主司《凤玉赋》，爲时所称。\n」次年试，梦人告以当在榜末及第。\n「言讫，院吏报先辈第九人。\n是年只放进士九人，果符所梦。\n」据所述，当爲唐五代间事。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于观文","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56289.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56289","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}